      {
        "kind": "steps",
        "body": "1. Mittellinie: $m = \\frac{{{a}} + {{c}}}{2} = {{= (a+c)/2}}$ cm\n2. $A = m \\cdot h = {{= (a+c)/2}} \\cdot {{h}} = {{= (a+c)/2*h}}\\,\\text{cm}^2$"
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer",
        "body": "{{= (a+c)/2*h}} cm²"
      }
